Scalp care is the new skin care

Overdrawn eyebrows and bountiful butts had their moment in the mid-2010s, j=
ust as glowy skin has had its in recent years. But now, consumers and brand=
s are fixating on another region of our anatomy: the scalp.

Interest in treatments and products dedicated to the crown of our heads has=
 exploded in recent years =E2=80=94 so much so that some beauty insiders ar=
e calling it the new =E2=80=9Cit=E2=80=9D body part, per (https://www.nytim=
es.com/2025/11/20/style/scalp-care-beauty-trends-2025.html?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz=
-8ZCBLrj0V-8PY-A50P0BOgHP8yJdaFKTZkY_OmNClDFz4xVKzzu96utVpM5fM5_h-nuKmxrPzk=
GNct3sLsvgdkikgKpg&_hsmi=3D395310945 ) The New York Times.

- Searches, views, and posts for =E2=80=9Cscalp serum=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=
=9Cscalp massagers=E2=80=9D were up 77% and 58%, respectively, in August 20=
25 compared to the year before across Google, TikTok, and Instagram.

- Searches for =E2=80=9Chead spas=E2=80=9D =E2=80=94 where you can pay anyw=
here from $35 to $330 to take a microscopic look at your roots =E2=80=94 ha=
ve hit an all-time high (https://trends.google.com/trends/explore?date=3Dal=
l&q=3Dhead%20spas&hl=3Den&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8ZCBLrj0V-8PY-A50P0BOgHP8yJdaFKT=
ZkY_OmNClDFz4xVKzzu96utVpM5fM5_h-nuKmxrPzkGNct3sLsvgdkikgKpg&_hsmi=3D395310=
945 ) on Google.

Haircare brands have capitalized on the heightened consumer demand, with mo=
st now offering, or preparing to offer (https://www.unilever.com/news/news-=
search/2025/the-skinification-of-scalp-care-unilevers-expertise-delivers-on=
-demand/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8ZCBLrj0V-8PY-A50P0BOgHP8yJdaFKTZkY_OmNClDFz4xVKz=
zu96utVpM5fM5_h-nuKmxrPzkGNct3sLsvgdkikgKpg&_hsmi=3D395310945 ) , some kind=
 of scalp serum or treatment, packed with buzzy ingredients like ceramides =
and hyaluronic acid, as remedies for itchiness, dryness, or hair density.

There are also companies like Nutrafol and Hims hocking hair growth supplem=
ents, and upstarts like Jolie and Canopy selling shower head filters that p=
romise to reduce shedding and help with dandruff.

The trend is no head scratcher

Scalp care, a fast-growing sector of the ~$107B (https://www.fortunebusines=
sinsights.com/hair-care-market-102555?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8ZCBLrj0V-8PY-A50P0B=
OgHP8yJdaFKTZkY_OmNClDFz4xVKzzu96utVpM5fM5_h-nuKmxrPzkGNct3sLsvgdkikgKpg&_h=
smi=3D395310945 ) global hair care market, is the latest self-care fad to d=
azzle Gen Z and millennial men and women, popularized online by TikTok tuto=
rials, influencers, and wellness enthusiasts.

It also coincides with the growing popularity of beauty products and practi=
ces from Asian countries (https://wwd.com/beauty-industry-news/beauty-featu=
res/k-beauty-asian-beauty-global-wave-skin-care-makeup-hair-1237872768/?_hs=
enc=3Dp2ANqtz-8ZCBLrj0V-8PY-A50P0BOgHP8yJdaFKTZkY_OmNClDFz4xVKzzu96utVpM5fM=
5_h-nuKmxrPzkGNct3sLsvgdkikgKpg&_hsmi=3D395310945 ) like Korea and Japan, w=
here head spas have been around for decades (https://whyy.org/articles/phil=
adelphia-head-spas-scalp-treatments/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8ZCBLrj0V-8PY-A50P0BO=
gHP8yJdaFKTZkY_OmNClDFz4xVKzzu96utVpM5fM5_h-nuKmxrPzkGNct3sLsvgdkikgKpg&_hs=
mi=3D395310945 ) and scalp health is a centuries-old priority.

But is it necessary?

Probably not =E2=80=94 while scalp massagers can promote hair growth by inc=
reasing circulation and treatments can help alleviate dryness or itchiness,=
 it=E2=80=99s not like everyone=E2=80=99s suddenly developed scalp conditio=
ns that would call for them.

In fact, one dermatologist told NYT, putting unnecessary chemicals on a per=
fectly healthy scalp can cause issues like irritation and inflammation, whi=
le the minority (https://yougov.com/en-us/articles/52808-us-hair-care-trend=
s-2025-consumer-concerns-routines-and-market?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8ZCBLrj0V-8PY=
-A50P0BOgHP8yJdaFKTZkY_OmNClDFz4xVKzzu96utVpM5fM5_h-nuKmxrPzkGNct3sLsvgdkik=
gKpg&_hsmi=3D395310945 ) of people with actual scalp conditions, like alope=
cia or seborrheic dermatitis, would be better off consulting a medical prof=
essional.

That being said, a good head spa sesh can still be a luxuriously relaxing t=
ime =E2=80=94 which, one could argue, is an occasional must.

