ictably mixed. <br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">While we do expect to see robots and AI model=
s infiltrate more of our lives than perhaps we want them to, this robot may=
 be entirely sci-fi for now. It=E2=80=99s entirely unclear how exactly the =
bot becomes pregnant or deals with the numerous complicated elements of a p=
regnancy, so we wouldn=E2=80=99t hold our breath on this one.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
