#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"2wfhg3Ak" target=3D"_b=
lank">agentic AI</a>, which can make decisions and perform autonomous tasks=
 on behalf of its user.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Some examples you=E2=80=99re likely to see mo=
re of this year:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Self-driving vehicl=
es: </span>Agentic AI is behind the wheel. Waymo rolled&nbsp;out in numerou=
s cities in 2025, and started <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/=
UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9p-2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3=
p_W6F2-dc59TSzsW8NJlj1543WYjW7Z0VBj7qljl-W54j_7c6XxZQpW3B1V8L4YfYDCW83BqxP1=
