r:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"btDhEhup" target=3D"=
_blank">operating</a>&nbsp;in&nbsp;Minneapolis, New Orleans, and Tampa, Flo=
rida, with human safety drivers. It will also allow fully autonomous rides =
in Miami, Dallas, Houston, San Antonio, and Orlando in 2026. There may be s=
ome resistance, however. San Franciscans were <a href=3D"https://media.hubs=
