 control over how robotaxis are deployed in their communities.&nbsp;<br><br=
></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1"><strong>Browsers: </strong>Agentic web browsers includ=
ing Perplexity=E2=80=99s Comet, ChatGPT=E2=80=99s Atlas, and Opera=E2=80=99=
s Neon seek to make web browsing a seamless experience where AI can do thin=
gs like fill out forms, summarize content, and complete bookings for their =
users. Other browsers, including Google Chrome and Mozilla=E2=80=99s Firefo=
x, are incorporating AI.<br><br>Such browsers may threaten Chrome=E2=80=99s=
 long-standing dominance if they achieve widespread adoption, but reviews a=
re currently mixed. <span style=3D"font-style: italic;">PC Mag</span>=E2=80=
=99s Ruben Circelli <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q=
-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9p-2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3l5W8zzZt01=
L2tXnW85yd601bD1ZhW71rc8d7JmPVSW2PWn6Q1xT-7dW8wgSd63vQzhHW1TX4bG7jvZLQW7f7V=
Gs8qnX1pW4f7F3P7pFLXXW5Jz8Fh79s7K9W4kSM955TwZcpW495TlZ5FfQMtN9kwMjK3Hq3dN84=
Fh8psCTDbV-BYSd5XCfx_W3L0fMR4P3YFRW3W1CCk8-J5QTN7htmFCF_KybW23cHW24vCq_7W3V=
