uired too much babysitting to outperform traditional browsers. And for peop=
le with data privacy concerns, DuckDuckGo remains a favorite.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Shopping: </span>Am=
azon rolled out its =E2=80=9C<a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/U=
B+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9p42-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3n=
