visualize what outfits might look like on you or how a piece of furniture m=
ight look in your home, and you=E2=80=99ve got a pretty high-tech retail ex=
perience brewing. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Travel: </span>Agen=
tic AI is also expected to make its way into the travel sector, with <a hre=
f=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7=
kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9pn2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3mfW4tXtBN2vFClNW4_mKp37Z13p7W5DmqyH1=
