data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"qD5itjlS" target=3D"_blank">80%</a> of travel execs p=
lanning to roll out agentic AI tools at scale within the next five years. S=
uch assistants would ideally find flights and lodging options based on your=
 preferences, compare prices, come up with itineraries, and handle booking.=
</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-size:18px"><span style=3D"font-weight: b=
old;">To the moon</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">No, we=E2=80=99re not talking about crypto, t=
hankfully. We=E2=80=99re talking about literally going to the moon. <a href=
=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7k=
r3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9nP2-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3mXW4Mv2K78k7wfvW4wFPYx26btDQW5tyBmn3v=
