<ul style=3D"line-height:150%"></ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:22px">Scalp care =
is the new skin care</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Overdrawn eyebrows and bountiful butts had th=
eir moment in the mid-2010s, just as glowy skin has had its in recent years=
. But now, consumers and brands are fixating on another region of our anato=
my: the scalp.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Interest in treatments and products dedicated=
 to the crown of our heads has exploded in recent years =E2=80=94 so much s=
o that some beauty insiders are calling it the new =E2=80=9Cit=E2=80=9D bod=
y part, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS1=
26hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9pn2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3mrW4qTGnq625TFKVq4n0p6=
_Zvp8W3bpzSL8cXg2MVl_WTV1jhmCmN2KgbbZxt5-vW4tq8dN4QVLm0W7sD2BC1L7LxbW1wn9KY=
5jr4XGW5HhdVM8HF6WFW3h8mSS4Hp6-RF4_0CkFGTgVW4MllzC777FJFW5g6gbs76QW1kVycqF9=
34h_q1W2pP_CP3JyLbVW1J9x6M4gXvYxW8j0f-H97NfxCW7dyCfs8KXxqYVNPFk13bTwLTW7H29=
fp6ZFXmwVGsSdc5Tc0ZYW77ZSQx7_cH9rf5Dy8_b04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs=
-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"BeTs3xRr" target=3D"_blank">per</a> <s=
pan style=3D"font-style: italic;">The New York Times</span>.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Searches, views, and posts for =E2=80=9Cscalp serum=E2=
=80=9D and =E2=80=9Cscalp massagers=E2=80=9D were up 77% and 58%, respectiv=
ely, in August 2025 compared to the year before across Google, TikTok, and =
Instagram.&nbsp;<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Searches for =E2=80=9Chead spas=E2=80=9D =E2=80=94 whe=
re you can pay anywhere from $35 to $330 to take a microscopic look at your=
 roots =E2=80=94 have hit an <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/U=
B+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9pn2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3p=
QW8yH3F96cvs9kW3YQ8PV65PlZdVV0JhJ3p9tQwW2Cz94j8xbKBsW7_D_pN6FqLrFW8gQ5cQ1y8=
RJ7N39QX4PcJJHqW2LdrfY59TvyWW7g6WzP1q1PMsW81r41g4ZX9V_W5SLmmy61_jgHW1mrDWC6=
wyJWMW7pq_Qf80PhcqW6hc6yj32v1YgW40jMMB28_37fW6Z7Pk93WTCpgN6KQ31W9dhdvW87WGz=
H25mSKgW1Pn2MF2XK6JVW6jhY3p2Bt9CCW9d7J053CSM8QW6rrNS384nXp7f4K3f3F04" style=
=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"KHViztwZ" ta=
rget=3D"_blank">all-time high</a> on Google.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Haircare brands have capitalized on the heigh=
tened consumer demand, with most now offering, or <a href=3D"https://media.=
hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_=
h9qg2-ZW0W8wLKSR6lZ3pWW4F_w-d4q4B0mW242pWX6KjzglW2l2xVJ1sCWvfW5kS0Bl9jxV3ZW=
8vxMmn409gQWW5rFQ_D4xnR59VWCDZF60TrvpW82Bs4s5WmQ85W7MgdR313whSdW3Y1W_J8Bm30=
wW9kfYZS1B6BY0W8sltd61FCY0WW1Lpx0J7frdd0W3x_2vF2x4BPrW6_DpH03C8yJ-W5chmVM3h=
GYM6W8N1BHb3nhxc3W2tqptB1XDTLzW3Mx5wq5HrkJ3VQ3qpX5JSlvGN5lb7ysnVdR6W3dZJ5K7=
58wBWW10DWHN76SyHMN6XV2-XQMqCqN3dsqpqqpVB9W5SNDS54K1zK5W8N_Rs33qrWkJW2PtrkP=
6Ctq6Bf25-J7F04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link=
-id-v2=3D"9HBYBU0t" target=3D"_blank">preparing to offer</a>, some kind of =
scalp serum or treatment, packed with buzzy ingredients like ceramides and =
hyaluronic acid, as remedies for itchiness, dryness, or hair density.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">There are also companies like Nutrafol and Hi=
ms hocking hair growth supplements, and upstarts like Jolie and Canopy sell=
ing shower head filters that promise to reduce shedding and help with dandr=
uff.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">The trend i=
s no head scratcher</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Scalp care, a fast-growing sector of the <a h=
ref=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDN=
z7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9pn2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3nyN3PNJnMRd1BrV_7BNq30l_BcW5QKpsm2=
wC7tLW5kcTLt90gYdRW25kcJm2PLzgrW4YN1-Z4S_JQtW38FKJc7hn3wrVzLKzF4VgyzFV53MgY=
5v4HFHW6N59NH5C_Xd9W9k97y91hJSXKW1MCgYJ5LQss1W6dx7Nk3KgR2NVVGDTp1WH8GSW74_z=
KG24Jj7lW39sRcF2bnx8bW6dCsCs27F-kWW4Z6-Fp514t-mW1GCXHD99-XhHW7Rtswy8JY6_TVQ=
jj-w6Bbh2RMx4SFmlM0ZDf7PyKQz04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"=
0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"RpEmKO/B" target=3D"_blank">~$107B</a> global hair=
 care market, is the latest self-care fad to dazzle Gen Z and millennial me=
n and women, popularized online by TikTok tutorials, influencers, and welln=
ess enthusiasts.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">It also coincides with the growing popularity=
 of beauty products and practices from <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com=
/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9qg2-ZW0W8=
wLKSR6lZ3n_N3-lCyxvXD0DW3ClxWc8T_Mx8W7rVNfK7FqNbQW18K1pj3Nf6DbW8_B_CK4BFm3D=
W4F7XTn2HxWJvT_gCC2RGD0_W2VBdPL6XSrX9W6vB8MJ5k6FRZW41Ygks7p5Qc3W6dHkG52Nh47=
qVY877f5GyHBLW7Y3b865zmswFW58mxjb72QXgrW9g9_b650WT1lW884Gyz135KVwMWS_Z1_-L3=
6W2ft3DD94pCPHW5RH4qk8Gf2tHW50q55-4F41zTN3cB78sdZPZ2MXjfCnYdVH_W4fLBsw2jsfs=
ZW2Tc2Wk8T9JppW6zBQn_27G0q9W2Mnx7b1Fh6PLW3htW-s7DMTczVWcvyc54dFccf5X8yg804"=
 style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"VEMXUC=
Hl" target=3D"_blank">Asian countries</a> like Korea and Japan, where head =
spas have been around for <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+1=
13/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9pn2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3mVW6=
vWx1t1LshzKW73P8tt1f64F2W4Qz4XY4BDsDxW5x_q7S458mKmW68YND_5cGPjTW8wm6666yLS9=
VW1FG2dw90KfTjW3lFXZx92cVbpW7MMCCj68-KH8W67Jl3z6ZbGg_W3nBFt183H6L6VlL0bg1-9=
Xg9W1q79vz8rMTT5W5VPXc46Dvv4mW26fbWG7_w-lLW1k9CRz4j6GSLN8CXjD3_MlbbW4_PwRH2=
9wNYVW7-2vPm2fmxt0W1jnVjd8j6k4sW2LzYy08jLVK2W3dGfHV4yyLQqf87tr1604" style=
=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"iIxpe+JT" ta=
rget=3D"_blank">decades</a> and scalp health is a centuries-old priority.&n=
bsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">But is it n=
ecessary?</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Probably not =E2=80=94 while scalp massagers =
can promote hair growth by increasing circulation and treatments can help a=
lleviate dryness or itchiness, it=E2=80=99s not like everyone=E2=80=99s sud=
denly developed scalp conditions that would call for them.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">In fact, one dermatologist told <span style=
=3D"font-style: italic;">NYT</span>, putting unnecessary chemicals on a per=
fectly healthy scalp can cause issues like irritation and inflammation, whi=
le the <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS12=
6hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hvV_gMC15HQf4qM_h9p-2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3nvW21f9k65PG5bvW3ynx5w4=
Zz-37W8l6mDY3Rc2WXW5C_Wy27YZZNBW96M8pz880Lh3VS38dQ1-49k9W84NP_b2xvtHyVd-Brr=
9jd0bcW6mtXCV3Gyx54W5VNVgv9g8BS4W3YgzL91GHQGxW8RWv2R3LF7SxW92Dzvc2-GWD5W8vl=
ggv7CTk0zW7_Gfhv3wYSHpW1ncgy54MkmcpW7G_Wz24KcSh6N5GmGfqqppCDN8XNtmDccSL3W3X=
s0bD2CTjydVkC-hR6TMlVdW7rJs046lcjq7W22ZtSM1TjxGSW4ztg711gnbMQW2NRK9T1SVJ37W=
3sh4C22xP5BDf24Jp6j04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-h=
s-link-id-v2=3D"d+9Ci7Vy" target=3D"_blank">minority</a> of people with act=
ual scalp conditions, like alopecia or seborrheic dermatitis, would be bett=
er off consulting a medical professional.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">That being said, a good head spa sesh can sti=
ll be a luxuriously relaxing time =E2=80=94 which, one could argue, is an o=
ccasional must.<br><span style=3D"font-size: 14px;"><br></span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; text-align:right" align=3D"right"><a href=3D"=
https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVKVS126hVLSW6qyDNz7kr3hv=
